      "cooked": "<p>Could someone clarify if we did this correctly?</p><p>KNYFE, Haka &amp; The Wraith vs. The Dreamer in Megalopolis:</p><p>Haka had 5 projection cards under Savage Mana when The Dreamer flipped to the Roused from Slumber side.&nbsp; Hx2 projection cards were needed under The Dreamer to win.&nbsp; KNYFE destroyed one projection, and then Haka used Savage Mana to deal 1 target 10 damage.&nbsp; The win condition for The Dreamer is to put destroyed projections under her card, so we put those cards destroyed by Savage Mana under her card and won.&nbsp; Should the cards instead have gone to The Dreamer's trash?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:24.914Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
