      "cooked": "<p>Okay so cards under other cards do not have text, which means we did it wrong in that game and shouldn't have won so easily.</p><p>So why, then, are Victims under Spite's Safe House card still considered Victims?&nbsp; Can someone point me in the direction of this in the rules so I can read it for myself?</p><p>Thanks :)</p>",
