      "created_at": "2014-09-01T18:38:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/sotm_rules_and_clarifications.pdf\">Spiff's FAQ</a>&nbsp;would be the place to start. It spells out very clearly the rules for Savage Mana. Flipped Drugs are still considered Drugs. There are a few times where it doesn't seem to work, but mostly for simplicity in the text. The general rule is that cards under other cards have no text.</p>",
